---
import Mark from "./Mark.astro";

const MANNERS = [
  "robots.txt is obeyed, and there is deliberately no override flag.",
  "Every domain is rate limited, and a Crawl-delay in robots.txt always wins over the config.",
  "The user agent is honest and identifiable, never randomized.",
];
---

<section class="section overflow-hidden" id="manners">
  <div class="mesh mesh-deep"></div>

  <div class="shell relative z-10">
    <h2 class="h-display max-w-[16ch]" data-reveal>
      When a site refuses, reapfield stops.
    </h2>

    <p class="lede mt-6" data-reveal>
      Defeating anti-bot systems is not a goal, and it is not on a roadmap
      somewhere. Cloudflare, DataDome and PerimeterX are detected, named in the
      error, and obeyed.
    </p>

    <ul class="mt-10 grid max-w-[72ch]">
      {
        MANNERS.map((m) => (
          <li
            class="border-t border-rule-soft py-3 text-copy text-fg-dim first:border-t-0"
            data-reveal
          >
            {m}
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="border-t border-rule py-10">
  <div class="shell flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-micro text-fg-dim">
      <Mark size={18} />
      <span>reapfield</span>
    </div>
    <div class="-mr-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-micro">
      <a
        class="link link-target"
        href="https://github.com/PedroHenriqueNS/reapfield"
        rel="noopener">GitHub</a
      >
      <a
        class="link link-target"
        href="https://github.com/PedroHenriqueNS/reapfield/blob/main/LICENSE"
        rel="noopener">MIT</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
